# Business cards (`/business-cards`)

## Authority

1. **Official reference artwork** (mustard marketing front + forest operational back) — kept as design targets when exported PNGs are attached to the task or saved under project assets.
2. **`business-card/Golf-Sol-Ireland-Business-Card.pdf`** — supplementary print proof only; **do not** revert the live page to unrelated ivory/fleet-column layouts unless product asks.

The marketing **front** is **not** the operational ivory duplex from older explorations: it is a **solid mustard / gold field** with centred copy and a **four-icon social row** (Facebook, Instagram, X, LinkedIn).

The **back** is **deep forest green** with **only** the **homepage crest** (`/golfsol-crest-footer.png`, fallback `/golfsol-crest.svg`) — **no** separate wordmark SVG (`golf-sol-ireland-logo.svg`) on the card faces.

