Group the grid under section headings **Gregg McDonald** and **Martin Kelly**.

## Front (mustard) — copy & structure

- Background: bright mustard / golden yellow (tokenised in catalog as `MUSTARD`, aligned to `#EEC339`-class tones — adjust only to match reference screenshots).
- Centred layout; generous padding.
- **Slogan (italic, large):** “From Plane To Fairway” — **From Plane** white; **To Fairway** forest green `#063B2A`.
- **Headline (bold caps):**  
  `ARRIVE IN MALAGA`  
  `LET US DO THE REST`
- **Body (italic, smaller, white):** four lines — meet & greet, flight awareness, clubs, hotel (exact strings in `CardMustardFront`).
- **Footer:** social buttons styled per reference — Facebook ring in forest green; Instagram gradient tile; X black disc; LinkedIn blue tile. URLs from `businessCardSocial` + `xTwitter`.

## Back (forest) — structure

- Background: `#063B2A` with **fleet lineup** photo strip (`BRAND_FLEET_LINEUP_IMAGE_SRC`) along the **bottom**, blended upward with a **forest gradient** (no harsh cut).
- **Logo:** homepage crest only (`businessCardAssets.crestWidePng` → PNG/SVG fallback).
- **Name** + **OPERATIONS MANAGER** (Gregg vs Martin only difference between people).
- **Phones:** Ireland / Spain labels italic white; numbers **bold gold** `#FFC72C`. Display formats mirror reference (`353 …`, `0034 …`) via helpers — **tel:** links use normalised digits from `businessCardContact`.
- **Email / Web:** `businessCardContact.email`, `businessCardContact.websiteDisplay` — **Email:** / **Web:** prefixes.

Do **not** add Co. Reg. or extra logos unless reference artwork explicitly includes them.

## Landscape behaviour

- **Front:** split marketing copy into **two columns** on wide cards (slogan + headline vs body), social row **anchored bottom** — do **not** only rotate the portrait layout.
- **Back:** **crest column + credentials column** with fleet band still **full width** at bottom.

## Data

- People: `businessCardOperationsTeam` in `business-cards-config.ts`.
- Contact + social: `businessCardContact`, `businessCardSocial` (includes `xTwitter`).

## PDF export

Hidden `#business-cards-pdf-export-root` must expose one `[data-pdf-page]` block per spec ID for `save-business-cards-pdf.ts`.

